<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Birthday!</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            background-color: #fdf6f0;
            color: #333;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background: #ffffff;
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #e07a5f;
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1.1em;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #555;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .signature {
            margin-top: 30px;
            text-align: right;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #3d405b;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <h1>🎉 Happy Birthday! 🎂</h1>
        <p>Dear [Name],</p>
        <p>
            Wishing you the happiest of birthdays today! May your year ahead be full of 
            joy, success, and wonderful memories. Thank you for being such an incredible 
            person in my life.
        </p>
        <p class="signature">With love,<br>[Your Name]</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
